                              |GKBPHOENIX RISING
|YK0================================================================

|YKB'You may strike down the Phoenix, but he will be reborn from his
ashes to repay your hostility.'|WKO - |RKBGrand Master Xian Yung|YK0

The ultimate definition of the Phoenix is their ability to rise
from the death, every bit as powerful as they were. While a Monk
is one with the Phoenix, they will be granted the same ability.
A Monk may be struck down, but they will rise.

|BKBThis is a Grand Master power.

